msgctxt "112"
msgid "Kiryu... You're back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "For now, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"And I see you brought a little someone with you. Guess that means "
"everything's settled, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"We won't have to worry about Joji Kazama or having our land\r\n"
"taken away from us anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "And the Hakuho Clan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"That's actually why I'm here. I have reason to believe Mine\r\n"
"is on his way to the hospital where Daigo's staying, and I\r\n"
"need to stop him before it's too late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Any way I can help?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "...Yeah. Look after Haruka while I'm gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"What, that's it? You're... not thinking of heading in there\r\n"
"all on your own, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I am."
msgstr "Sono io."

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Now hold on a second! You can't just... Ah, what am I thinking? No matter "
"how hard I fight, you're still gonna do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"All right. I'll keep Haruka safe and sound while you're\r\n"
"gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "I appreciate it, Date-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "But do me something before you go. Say goodbye to her, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Heh, I can do that."
msgstr ""

